Derived from web-esheep by Adriano Petrucci (GPL-3.0):
    https://github.com/Adrianotiger/web-esheep

The sprite sheet (assets/esheep-sprites.png) and the animation definitions in
assets/animations.xml come from that project's `pets/original.xml`, which is in
turn a recreation of the 1995 "eSheep" / stray sheep desktop pet. The animation
data here has had its embedded base64 spritesheet and icon payloads stripped,
since the sheet ships alongside it as a PNG; it is otherwise unmodified.
